{"lang":"ko","dir":"ltr","title":"La Piñata Taqueria | 캘리포니아 발레호의 타코 트럭 &amp; 부리토","body":"<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">본문으로 건너뛰기</a>\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap topbar-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">LP</span><span>La Piñata Taqueria</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\"><a href=\"#about\">소개</a><a href=\"menu/\">메뉴</a><a href=\"#faq\">자주 묻는 질문</a><a href=\"#gallery\">사진</a><a href=\"#reviews\">리뷰</a><a href=\"#visit\">영업시간 및 위치</a></nav>\n    <label class=\"lang-pick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20zm6.9 6h-2.9a15.7 15.7 0 0 0-1.4-3.6A8 8 0 0 1 18.9 8zM12 4c.8 1.2 1.5 2.5 1.9 4h-3.8c.4-1.5 1.1-2.8 1.9-4zM4.3 14a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0-4h3.4a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0 4H4.3zm.8 2h2.9c.3 1.3.8 2.5 1.4 3.6A8 8 0 0 1 5.1 16zM8 8H5.1a8 8 0 0 1 4.3-3.6C8.8 5.5 8.3 6.7 8 8zm4 12c-.8-1.2-1.5-2.5-1.9-4h3.8c-.4 1.5-1.1 2.8-1.9 4zm2.3-6H9.7a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0-4h4.6a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0 4zm.3 5.6c.6-1.1 1.1-2.3 1.4-3.6h2.9a8 8 0 0 1-4.3 3.6zM16.3 14a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0-4h3.4a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0 4h-3.4z\"/></svg><select id=\"langSel\" aria-label=\"언어\"><option value=\"en\" lang=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"es\" lang=\"es\">Español</option><option value=\"tl\" lang=\"tl\">Tagalog</option><option value=\"vi\" lang=\"vi\">Tiếng Việt</option><option value=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\">中文</option><option value=\"pa\" lang=\"pa\">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ</option><option value=\"hi\" lang=\"hi\">हिन्दी</option><option value=\"ko\" lang=\"ko\" selected>한국어</option><option value=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">العربية</option></select></label>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17073348381\">주문</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"hero-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('images/hero-tacos.jpg')\"></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">타코 트럭 · 809 Broadway · 발레호</p>\n    <h1>La Piñata Taqueria</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">샌프란시스코 크로니클이 선정한 베이 지역 최고의 부리토 리스트에 오른 Broadway의 노란 타코 트럭. 바삭한 수아데로, 맛있는 살사 두 가지, 큼직한 슈퍼 부리토.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/La+Pi%C3%B1ata+Taqueria/@38.1147339,-122.2487791,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085739c1a6761fb:0x55c92816b09cb66b!8m2!3d38.1147339!4d-122.2487791!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>4.7 · Google 리뷰 276개<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17073348381\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> 전화로 미리 주문하기</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%2C%20809%20Broadway%2C%20Vallejo%2C%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> 길찾기</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li>Yelp 선정 미국 푸드트럭 Top 100 중 6위 (2025)</li><li>SF 크로니클 최고의 부리토 리스트 선정</li><li>포장, 전화 주문 &amp; 케이터링</li><li>야외 피크닉 테이블</li><li>월–금 11시–9시 영업</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">우리 트럭</p><h2>신선한 재료. 풍성한 맛. 합리적인 가격.</h2><p>La Piñata는 809 Broadway에 서 있는 노란 푸드트럭(lonchera)입니다. 신선하고 좋은 재료로 정통 멕시코 음식을 만듭니다. 타코, 토르타, 케사디야, 나초, 슈퍼 부리토, 새우 요리는 물론 오르차타와 히비스커스 음료(아구아 데 하마이카)도 있어요.</p><p>2025년 Yelp는 역대 미국 푸드트럭 Top 100 리스트에서 저희를 6위로 선정했고, 2022년 11월에는 샌프란시스코 크로니클이 베이 지역 최고의 부리토 리스트에 저희를 올렸습니다. 샌프란시스코에서 일부러 차를 몰고 오시는 손님도 계세요.</p><div class=\"facts\"><div class=\"fact\"><b>#6</b><span>Yelp 푸드트럭 Top 100</span></div><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/La+Pi%C3%B1ata+Taqueria/@38.1147339,-122.2487791,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085739c1a6761fb:0x55c92816b09cb66b!8m2!3d38.1147339!4d-122.2487791!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>4.7★</b><span>리뷰 276개</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>월–금</b><span>오전 11시–오후 9시</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/tacos.jpg\" alt=\"La Piñata 스트리트 타코 한 접시\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"menu\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">메뉴</p><h2>오늘의 메뉴</h2><p>타코, 슈퍼 부리토, 토르타, 나초, 케사디야.</p></div><div class=\"menu-cards\"><a class=\"menu-card\" href=\"menu/#m-tacos\"><img src=\"images/tacos-plate.jpg\" alt=\"고수, 양파, 래디시, 당근을 올린 La Piñata 타코 한 접시\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><h3>타코 (Tacos)</h3><ul><li><span>Taco</span><b>$3.50</b></li></ul></div></a><a class=\"menu-card\" href=\"menu/#m-burritos\"><img src=\"images/burrito-cut.jpg\" alt=\"포일 위에 반으로 자른 La Piñata 슈퍼 부리토\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><h3>부리토 (Burritos)</h3><ul><li><span>Super Burrito</span><b>$16</b></li><li><span>슈퍼 채식 부리토</span><b>$14</b></li><li><span>슈퍼 새우 부리토</span><b>$18</b></li></ul><span class=\"more\">+1개 더</span></div></a><a class=\"menu-card\" href=\"menu/#m-tortas-nachos-quesadillas\"><img src=\"images/chips-salsas-pickled-veggies.jpg\" alt=\"La Piñata의 칩, 레드·그린 살사, 당근 피클과 구운 할라피뇨\" loading=\"lazy\"><div><h3>토르타, 나초 &amp; 케사디야</h3><ul><li><span>Torta</span><b>$16</b></li><li><span>Super Nachos</span><b>$16</b></li><li><span>Super Quesadilla</span><b>$16</b></li></ul></div></a><a class=\"menu-card\" href=\"menu/#m-drinks\"><div><h3>음료</h3><ul><li><span>캔 탄산음료</span><b>$2</b></li><li><span>멕시코 탄산음료</span><b>$3</b></li><li><span>생수</span><b>$1</b></li></ul><span class=\"more\">+1개 더</span></div></a><a class=\"menu-card\" href=\"menu/#m-extras\"><div><h3>추가</h3><ul><li><span>타코에 치즈, 사워크림 또는 아보카도 추가</span><b>$0.25</b></li><li><span>부리토에 치즈, 사워크림 또는 아보카도 추가</span><b>$1</b></li></ul></div></a></div><div class=\"cta-row menu-cta\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"menu/\">전체 메뉴 &amp; 가격 보기 →</a></div><div class=\"menu-source\"><p>가격은 변동될 수 있습니다.</p></div></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">알아두세요</p><h2>방문 전 알아두세요</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>포장</b><span>가져가기 좋게 깔끔하게 포장해 드려요</span></li><li><b>전화 주문</b><span>미리 전화하고 기다리지 마세요</span></li><li><b>케이터링</b><span>트럭으로 전화해 문의해 주세요</span></li><li><b>현금 또는 카드</b><span>카드 결제 시 소액의 수수료가 붙을 수 있습니다</span></li><li><b>길가 주차</b></li><li><b>야외 좌석</b><span>피크닉 테이블</span></li><li><b>금요일 오후 6시경이 가장 붐벼요</b><span>최대 15분 정도 기다릴 수 있어요</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">갤러리</p><h2>트럭에서 바로 만든 맛</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/tacos-plate.jpg\" alt=\"고수, 양파, 래디시, 당근, 라임을 곁들인 타코 한 접시\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>타코</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"images/burrito-plate.jpg\" alt=\"당근 피클과 오르차타 한 잔을 곁들인 접시 위의 슈퍼 부리토\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>슈퍼 부리토</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"images/chips-salsas-pickled-veggies.jpg\" alt=\"칩, 레드·그린 살사, 당근 피클과 구운 할라피뇨\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>칩, 살사 &amp; 채소 피클</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"images/burrito-cut.jpg\" alt=\"포일 위에 반으로 자른 부리토\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>부리토</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"images/burrito-closeup.jpg\" alt=\"고기, 밥, 치즈가 가득 든 부리토 클로즈업\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>부리토</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"images/burrito-foil.jpg\" alt=\"포일에 싸여 한 입 베어 문 부리토\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>포장 부리토</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"press\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">언론 보도</p><h2>수상 및 언론 소개</h2></div><div class=\"press\"><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“Our latest obsession is this taco truck. Service is always awesome, employees are always pleasant, and service is fast. Today they packed our food [chicken tacos and super carne asada burritos] with everything extra: plenty of red and green salsa, chips and extra grilled onion/jalapeno. Everything was delicious.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>Yelp Top 100 Food Trucks in the US 2025 (#6)</b> · Yelp Elite Carla G. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/article/top-100-food-trucks-2025\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Read</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"press-item\"><blockquote>“A Suadero Super Burrito from La Piñata might be one of the best things to eat in Vallejo — it’s in the top five at least.”</blockquote><figcaption><b>San Francisco Chronicle</b> · Top Burritos in the Bay Area, Nov 2022</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">리뷰</p><h2>멀리서 와도 아깝지 않은 맛</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.7</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 리뷰 276개</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/La+Pi%C3%B1ata+Taqueria/@38.1147339,-122.2487791,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085739c1a6761fb:0x55c92816b09cb66b!8m2!3d38.1147339!4d-122.2487791!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google에서 리뷰 더 보기 →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.8</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Yelp</b> · 리뷰 438개</div><a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/la-pi%C3%B1ata-taqueria-vallejo#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp에서 리뷰 더 보기 →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“suadero super burrito 10/10 would recommend. best burrito i’ve had in a minute! my sister got a al pastor taco which was a also very good. solid salsa (red one is sooo good) and food comes with pickles veggies which i love. also jamaica and horchata are both great. the horchata has a little coconut flavor. we live in the city and this beats out the options there. i’d consider driving up for this food tysm &lt;3”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%20809%20Broadway%20Vallejo%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jan 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“La Piñata has been my favorite taco truck in Vallejo for years. Even after moving away, I still compare every taco spot to this one.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Henry D. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/la-pi%C3%B1ata-taqueria-vallejo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · May 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“This is by far the best burrito place in Vallejo hands down. In every bite of my steak and shrimp burrito you can taste the freshness of all the ingredients. He always gives me a free drink when I come. I can appreciate that level of consistent exceptional customer service. Highly Recommended La Piñata !!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%20809%20Broadway%20Vallejo%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“I came here after hearing such great things about La Pinata&#39;s suadero burritos, and they did not disappoint at all! This is a food truck with incredibly kind, hardworking staff…”</blockquote><figcaption>— Lynn N. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/la-pi%C3%B1ata-taqueria-vallejo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“La Piñata is so good. I come from San Francisco for it and always get it when I’m in the area. The owner and staff have amazing customer service and the food is always good and fresh. I don’t usually leave reviews but it’s worth it. My go to is the chicken and shrimp burrito and the steak and shrimp nachos. Chefs kiss!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%20809%20Broadway%20Vallejo%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Monster sized burritos, satisfying eats, actual REAL avocado slices instead of weird guacamole, lots and lots of outdoor seating, plus, ...wait for it.....access to an INDOOR restroom…”</blockquote><figcaption>— Echosaisis A. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/la-pi%C3%B1ata-taqueria-vallejo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a> · May 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Easily the best Taqueria in Vallejo NGL 🔥 2 Super Steak Burritos w/everything 2 Tacos-1 asada, 1 carnitas Didn&#39;t have to ask for extra sauce , customer service was A+ . 50 min drive was 100% worth it, will def be back”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%20809%20Broadway%20Vallejo%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Oct 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I got their lengua, cabeza and carnitas tacos. The most was so tender and flavorful. I don&#39;t feel like many do their lengua well, but theirs are definitely one of my favorites. Their salsas are both really good and have a lot of flavor.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%20809%20Broadway%20Vallejo%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Oct 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I really like to this place. I mean it&#39;s just a taco trailer but the food was good and hardy. The service was quick. And the guy running the thing was pretty nice.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=La%20Pi%C3%B1ata%20Taqueria%20809%20Broadway%20Vallejo%20CA%2094590\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Jan 2026</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">자주 묻는 질문</p><h2>궁금한 점을 알려드려요</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>미리 전화로 주문할 수 있나요?</summary><p>네! (707) 334-8381로 전화하셔서 미리 주문하시면 줄 서지 않으셔도 됩니다.</p></details><details><summary>영업시간은 어떻게 되나요?</summary><p>월요일부터 금요일까지 오전 11시부터 오후 9시까지 영업합니다. 토요일과 일요일은 쉽니다.</p></details><details><summary>카드 결제 되나요?</summary><p>네, 현금과 카드 모두 받습니다. 카드 결제 시 소액의 수수료가 붙을 수 있습니다.</p></details><details><summary>무엇을 주문하면 좋을까요?</summary><p>샌프란시스코 크로니클이 특별히 소개한 수아데로 슈퍼 부리토를 드셔 보세요. 알 파스토르, 렝구아, 카르니타스, 새우 부리토도 인기 메뉴입니다.</p></details><details><summary>케이터링 하시나요?</summary><p>네, 케이터링 합니다. 트럭으로 전화해 문의해 주세요.</p></details><details><summary>좌석과 주차 공간이 있나요?</summary><p>야외 피크닉 테이블이 있고, 주차는 주로 길가에 하시면 됩니다.</p></details><details><summary>언제 가장 붐비나요?</summary><p>금요일 오후 6시경이 가장 붐비며, 최대 15분 정도 기다리실 수 있습니다.</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">방문 안내</p>\n      <h2>영업시간 및 위치</h2>\n      <address>809 Broadway<br>Vallejo, CA 94590</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17073348381\">(707) 334-8381</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>월요일</td><td>11 AM – 9 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>화요일</td><td>11 AM – 9 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>수요일</td><td>11 AM – 9 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>목요일</td><td>11 AM – 9 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>금요일</td><td>11 AM – 9 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>토요일</td><td>휴무</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>일요일</td><td>휴무</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">주말 휴무. 현금 또는 카드 결제 가능(카드 결제 시 소액의 수수료가 붙을 수 있습니다). 케이터링도 하니 전화로 문의해 주세요.</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/640168939444142\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 8h3V4h-3a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2H8v4h2v8h4v-8h3l1-4h-4V8z\"/></svg><span>Facebook</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/la-pi%C3%B1ata-taqueria-vallejo#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Yelp</span></a><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/La+Pi%C3%B1ata+Taqueria/@38.1147339,-122.2487791,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085739c1a6761fb:0x55c92816b09cb66b!8m2!3d38.1147339!4d-122.2487791!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2l3 6.9 7.5.6-5.7 4.9 1.8 7.3L12 17.8 5.4 21.7l1.8-7.3L1.5 9.5 9 8.9z\"/></svg><span>Google reviews</span></a></div>\n      <div class=\"cta-row\">\n        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17073348381\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6